{"availability":"available","full":"Nyame-Wolf/movie-app","name":"movie-app","description":"This  is a web application that consumes the tvmaze API. It shows a list of 240 popular, TV shows . It allows users to add a comment about the movie as well as click on the like button if they enjoyed it","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2022-07-25T18:25:16Z","updated":"2022-07-30T10:33:32Z","branch":"development","homepage":"","topics":["css","html5"],"demo":"https://nyame-wolf.github.io/movie-app/dist/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:01.790Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:01.790Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:01.790Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:05.441Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T02:34:09.624Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:01.790Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["In this project @rominana and @Nyame-Wolf, created a movie app to rate and leave a comment about your favorite movies, as part of the Module2 Vanilla Javascript Capstone project. It uses the tvmaze Api to list shows. It has a comment popup which displays the show summary, image, number of comments and the comments, as well as a form to add more comments. It also displays the number of shows displayed, as well as the number of likes a show has received. The comment popup and the likes use the involvement api provided by Microverse."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nyame-Wolf/movie-app/blob/development/README.md","fingerprint":"de5542ee9efba5b23442109299ee3d95d017ebbd05c07081d0bca61826fd4b5f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:05.575Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:05.575Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"In this project @rominana and @Nyame-Wolf, created a movie app to rate and leave a comment about your favorite movies, as part of the Module2 Vanilla Javascript Capstone project. It uses t